WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:03,950
The house is fine. What do you want the house for?

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:05,590
Five hundred pounds of rice and fifty pounds of meat

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,710
One hundred eggs and ten fragrant milk, the house is mine

4
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:08,990
The house is for you

5
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:11,750
It's for sale. Where should we live?

6
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,470
In this way, the whole family will work for you

7
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,430
I'll give you half of the food

8
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,750
Just keep us safe

9
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:17,990
from today

10
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:24,910
You are the people in my territory

11
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,310
You are also a pastoral association

12
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,950
So much better than me

13
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,990
Now I know why

14
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,390
I don’t like your pot of vegetables anymore.

15
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,770
Almost seven thousand

16
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:46,930
AK is just a breath away

17
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:49,730
The land is taken up and the food supply is reduced.
